      <notesStmt>
        <annot>Volpiano: Cantus Database chant 1002583 (https://cantusdatabase.org/chant/1002583/), CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. Common of one Virgin. Neume division, shapes and facsimile zones: a close reading of the National Library of Finland scans of ff. 21r-21v (October 2026), written as square notation on the fragment's four-line staves with its clefs.</annot>
      </notesStmt>
